      <!-- Section 1: Physics & Math of Noise Colors -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          1. Fisika & Matematika Spektral Warna Noise
        </h2>
        <p>
          Dalam akustik dan pemrosesan sinyal, warna suara didefinisikan oleh <strong>Rapat Daya Spektral (PSD)</strong>—how energy is mathematically distributed across the audible frequency spectrum from 20 Hz to 20,000 Hz. While colloquially grouped as "background noise," different noise colors exert profoundly different neurological impacts on human cognitive processing and sleep architecture.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-6">
          
          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#8B5A2B" /></svg>
              <span>Brown Noise (Brownian / Red Noise)</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-normal">
              Daya menurun sebesar <strong>6 dB per oktaf ($1/f^2$)</strong>. Karena frekuensi tinggi difilter curam sementara frekuensi bass dikuatkan, Brown noise menghasilkan dengung kaya dan lembut mengingatkan pada hujan lebat, air terjun, atau mesin jet jauh.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-pink-500 dark:text-pink-400 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#EC4899" /></svg>
              <span>Pink Noise (Kemiringan Spektral 1/f)</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-normal">
              Daya menurun sebesar <strong>3 dB per oktaf ($1/f$)</strong>, menjaga energi setara pada oktaf musikal. Pink noise mencerminkan respons frekuensi logaritmik telinga manusia, menjadikannya standar klinis untuk masking tinnitus.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sky-500 dark:text-sky-400 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#a1a1aa" stroke-width="1.5" /></svg>
              <span>White Noise (Spektrum Datar $f^0$)</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-normal">
              Rapat daya setara pada setiap Hertz ($f^0$). Mengandung energi setara di semua pita terdengar, menghasilkan desis terang dan statis yang efektif menutupi bising rumah tangga bernada tinggi mendadak.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 space-y-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-500 dark:text-emerald-400 text-base flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" fill="#10B981" /></svg>
              <span>Green Noise (Pita Tengah Alami)</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-normal">
              Kurva frekuensi berbobot tengah berpuncak pada 500 Hz ($Q \approx 0.9$). Meniru lingkungan bio-akustik alami seperti semilir hutan, menurunkan aktivasi sistem saraf simpatik.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
